<Portfolio title="A Household Exorcism" description="A shipped supernatural adventure: explore a green-phosphor haunted house and speak or type to its ghosts. Learn about the game and its development."><section class="page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">01 / Shipped game · Windows</p><h1>A Household Exorcism</h1><p class="lead">Your childhood home is on the market. The ghosts still live there.</p><p>You’re the realtor, with three nights to settle the house before the open house. Explore, listen, and work out what each presence needs.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="https://aestheticengine.itch.io/a-household-exorcism">Play on itch.io ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="#making">How it was made ↓</a></div></section><figure class="wide-image"><img src="/images/house.png" width="794" height="447" alt="Dining room exploration and inventory in A Household Exorcism"/><figcaption>IN-GAME CAPTURE / The house, drawn in green-phosphor vector art.</figcaption></figure>
