<section class="section prose-grid"><h2>A conversation<br/>with the house.</h2><div><p>Voice and typed input feed the same offline intent system. Investigate rooms, use what you find, and choose how to address the presence on the other side of the spirit box.</p><p>Each night changes the haunting. Time and composure put pressure on your decisions, while the visual language of early microcomputer adventures makes the familiar house feel strange.</p><dl class="facts"><div><dt>Format</dt><dd>Single-player adventure</dd></div><div><dt>Interaction</dt><dd>Voice, text & mouse</dd></div><div><dt>Release</dt><dd>Windows · September 2026</dd></div></dl></div></section>
